%% Sequence: WalletTransactionDialog em modo "Reportar saldo" (balance mode)
%% Spec: Docs/specs/wallet-balance-mode.md
%% ADR: Docs/architecture/decisions/038-wallet-tx-optimistic-concurrency.md
%%
%% Cobre:
%%  - Happy path: cliente envia expectedPreviousBalance, backend valida dentro da TX, persiste.
%%  - Drift detectado: backend retorna 409 balance_mismatch, cliente refetch + recomputa preview.
%%  - Modo "Movimento" preservado (sem expectedPreviousBalance) para contraste.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Jogador
    participant UI as WalletTransactionDialog
    participant QC as queryClient (TanStack)
    participant API as POST /api/wallets/:id/transactions
    participant Svc as walletService.recordWalletTransaction
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over User,UI: Dialog abre apos GET /api/wallets/:id<br/>UI captura saldoConhecido = wallet.balance no momento da abertura

    User->>UI: Alterna toggle para "Reportar saldo"
    User->>UI: Digita novoSaldo (ex: 1247.00)
    UI->>UI: delta = novoSaldo - saldoConhecido (ex: 67.00)
    UI->>UI: preview "+R$ 67,00 (lucro)" verde<br/>botao Salvar habilitado

    User->>UI: Clica Salvar
    UI->>API: POST {direction:'in', nativeAmount:67.00,<br/>reason:'session_result',<br/>expectedPreviousBalance:1180.00,<br/>occurredAt, sessionId?, note?}

    API->>API: Zod valida body (expectedPreviousBalance opcional)
    API->>Svc: recordWalletTransaction(userId, walletId, input)

    Note over Svc,DB: Transacao atomica (ADR-034)
    Svc->>DB: BEGIN
    Svc->>DB: SELECT * FROM wallets WHERE id=walletId AND userId=X FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>Svc: wallet { balance: 1180.00, status:'active', ... }

    alt wallet status = 'archived'
        Svc->>DB: ROLLBACK
        Svc-->>API: 409 wallet_archived
        API-->>UI: 409
    end

    Note over Svc: ADR-038 — check de drift<br/>(so quando expectedPreviousBalance presente)

    alt expectedPreviousBalance presente E |actual - expected| > 0.01
        Svc->>DB: ROLLBACK
        Svc-->>API: throw makeError('balance_mismatch', 409,<br/>{ currentBalance: parseDecimal(wallet.balance) })
        API-->>UI: 409 { code:'balance_mismatch', currentBalance: 1247.50 }

        UI->>UI: Detecta 409 -> NAO fecha dialog
        UI->>User: Alerta inline "O saldo da carteira mudou.<br/>Saldo atual: R$ 1.247,50. Atualizar?"

        User->>UI: Clica "Atualizar"
        UI->>QC: invalidateQueries(['wallets', walletId])
        QC->>API: GET /api/wallets/:id (refetch)
        API-->>QC: wallet { balance: 1247.50, ... }
        QC-->>UI: dados frescos
        UI->>UI: saldoConhecido = 1247.50<br/>preview recomputa: novoSaldo (1247.00) - 1247.50 = -0.50<br/>label "-R$ 0,50 (perda)" vermelho<br/>(novoSaldo digitado preservado)

        Note over User,UI: Usuario revisa e re-submete manualmente<br/>com expectedPreviousBalance=1247.50
    end

    alt expectedPreviousBalance ausente OU dentro do epsilon 0.01
        Note over Svc: Caminho feliz — sem drift
        Svc->>Svc: pega FX corrente (user_settings.exchangeRates[ccy] ?? DEFAULT)
        Svc->>Svc: prev=1180, next=prev+67=1247 (direction='in')

        Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO wallet_transactions<br/>(walletId, direction, nativeAmount, fxRateUSDPerNative,<br/>previousNativeBalance:1180, newNativeBalance:1247, reason, ...)
        DB-->>Svc: { transactionId }

        Svc->>DB: UPDATE wallets SET balance=1247, updatedAt=NOW() WHERE id=walletId
        DB-->>Svc: ok

        Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO bankroll_snapshots<br/>(walletId, nativeAmount, fxRateUSDPerNative, delta_USD, ...)<br/>(espelho compat v1, HIGH-5)
        DB-->>Svc: ok

        Svc->>DB: COMMIT
        Svc-->>API: { transaction, wallet }
        API-->>UI: 201 Created
        UI->>QC: invalidateQueries(['wallets', walletId, 'bankroll', 'walletTransactions'])
        UI->>User: Toast "Transacao registrada" + dialog fecha
    end

    Note over User,UI: Modo "Movimento" (contraste): UI nao envia expectedPreviousBalance.<br/>Backend pula o check ADR-038. Comportamento legacy preservado 100%.
